erships). All three α=β=0 baselines match ordinary K-Means exactly. 19.2% of BioCLIP multi-membership sets persist exactly across seeds 42/43/44 after alignment.</p><p class="limit"><b>Limit.</b> No labels enter fitting. α sets a membership budget; β caps unassigned images. Budget-induced overlap is not automatically meaningful. Seed stability is an algorithmic check; visual interpretation remains illustrative, not validated. Objectives across different assignment budgets are not directly comparable.</p></section><section id="4"><small>EXPERIMENT 4</small><h2>What is enriched in each cluster?</h2><p><b>Question.</b> Are organ, photographic scale and family associated with geometry-only clusters?</p><p><b>Method.</b> Composition = label image memberships / cluster image memberships. Fold enrichment divides by label images / all 1,641 images. Separate inferential tables collapse each audited individual/duplicate component to any cluster membership and any label presence, then one-sided Fisher tests with BH correction per encoder × clustering × label factor. No image-level independence is assumed for those p-values.</p><table border="1" class="dataframe">
