inversion.py">Reproducible pixel-optimization script</a></p><p class="finding">All six runs move closer in feature space, but final outputs remain mainly colored noise. This short first run does not reconstruct recognizable botanical structure.</p><p class="limit"><b>Limit.</b> Exploratory feature inversion, not an image decoder or exact L4 reproduction. Few pixel steps and a weak smoothness prior do not establish uniqueness or semantic recovery; target and optimized image use the same normalization/encoder but different image creation paths. All initial/intermediate/final outputs are retained, without choosing a prettier seed or retrieving an original image.</p></section></main></html><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a52a2b331eebd691',t:'MTc5MzM2MDY3Mw=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a52a2b331eebd691',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script>
